id: mtm-zooners
name: Zooners
order: 9
optionOf: more-than-a-minion
optionEffect: 3
# Chosen for a character of that race, not asked (More than a Minion's `optionsByRace`).
forRace: zooner
description: >
  If you knock an Opponent through a Health Threshold with one of your Attacking Maneuvers, you may remove a stack of Focus Fatigue and then use a Ki Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
text: >
  Zooners [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you knock an Opponent through a Health Threshold with one of your Attacking Maneuvers, you may remove a stack of Focus Fatigue and then use a Ki Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# An Opponent knocked through by your attack, with Focus Fatigue (Nice Shooting's): a stack off, then a Ki Surge out of sequence - chosen on
# the attack's card, never Automatic (chat.mjs zoonerKiSurge).
[triggered/knock-through, 1/round, outOfSequence]
requires hasResource("focusfatigue");
zoonerKiSurge();
